      "evidence": "docs/api.rst states: \"All of Requests' functionality can be accessed by these 7 methods.\" and lists request, head, get, post, put, patch, and delete. However, src/requests/api.py defines and exports options in addition to those methods, and src/requests/__init__.py imports options into the public requests namespace.",
